MASSIVE is derived from the SLURP dataset.
Please cite: FitzGerald et al. (arXiv:2204.08582) and Bastianelli et al. (EMNLP 2020).

Changes made for this project: only the en-US, fr-FR and de-DE files were used, and only rows
from the calendar, transport, recommendation and weather scenarios. Only the date slot was
kept, as our label DATE, after removing past dates, clock times, stray words and repeats of
the same value. The place_name, time and timeofday slots were marked as ignored. All other
annotations were dropped.


