Copy used: the TidyTuesday copy of 11 February 2020, which stacks the two original files
(H1, resort hotel; H2, city hotel) into one hotels.csv:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rfordatascience/tidytuesday/master/data/2020/2020-02-11/hotels.csv

Changes made for this project: cancelled bookings, bookings with an average daily rate of 0 or
less, and rates more than ten times above or below the training median were removed; missing
children counts were set to 0; meal "Undefined" was merged into "SC"; only the columns known at
booking time were used. See docs/uc21_results.md.
